#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:169
#: 7664d9fb4fc3479ca06c480ac5391ac4
msgid "Starting Vicon"
msgstr "启动 Vicon"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:171
#: 5bd0f12fd71742c794846c13fe9a1891
msgid "Inside MAVProxy load the vicon module with:"
msgstr "在 MAVProxy 中使用以下命令加载 vicon 模块："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:177
#: 5c92831fe9a14222b7af37807a575bee
msgid ""
"If it doesn't load correctly then enable debugging with \"set moddebug 3\" "
"then try to load the module again."
msgstr "如果加载不正确，使用「set moddebug 3」启用调试，然后再次尝试加载模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:180
#: b50b481012f041b0941e10198e1ef4dc
msgid ""
"Once loaded you set set vicon parameters with \"vicon set\". Once you are "
"happy with the parameters then do \"vicon start\""
msgstr "加载后，使用「vicon set」设置 vicon 参数。对参数满意后，执行「vicon start」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:183
#: ece718d20d884f68b15f79cfcb73c9e2
msgid ""
"The MAVProxy console will then give status information for the Vicon, "
"showing position, attitude and messages rates. The vehicle should also get "
"GPS lock. It will show up at the GPS coordinates in the vicon module "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"MAVProxy 控制台将显示 Vicon 的状态信息，包括位置、姿态和消息速率。飞行器还应获得 GPS 定位，将显示在 vicon 模块设置中的 "
"GPS 坐标处。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:189
#: 6b8af37598864f8cb04efca153e48f22
msgid "Checking Orientations"
msgstr "检查方向"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:191
#: c07029907614492facb005f064910380
msgid ""
"Use the Vicon status line in the MAVProxy console to check that you have the"
" right orientation in the data coming from the Vicon. The VPos data is in "
"NED format in meters. The VATT data is euler angles of roll, pitch yaw. "
"Carefully check that these values are consistent while you rotate and move "
"the vehicle before proceeding."
msgstr ""
"使用 MAVProxy 控制台中的 Vicon 状态行检查从 Vicon 获取的数据方向是否正确。VPos 数据以米为单位的 NED 格式表示。VATT"
" 数据是横滚、俯仰、偏航的欧拉角。在继续之前，请仔细检查旋转和移动飞行器时这些值是否一致。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:198
#: 50b68b3ea14e4906b6a765980a6bad22
msgid "Test Flight"
msgstr "测试飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:200
#: 51ee779a5c0040438f1244765b598cb8
msgid ""
"You should see ArduPilot first report that EKF3 gets yaw alignment, and then"
" that it is using the GPS. After that you should be able to arm and fly."
msgstr "您应该首先看到 ArduPilot 报告 EKF3 获得偏航对齐，然后报告正在使用 GPS。之后应能够解锁并飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:204
#: 2e79dcb9e590433e829f0865bf115a07
msgid ""
"For a first test flight STABILIZE or ALT_HOLD mode is recommended. Then get "
"the flight log from the microSD card and check that the EKF3 innovations are"
" low. The position, velocity and yaw normalised innovations should all be "
"low (below 0.1)."
msgstr ""
"首次测试飞行建议使用 Stabilize 或 AltHold 模式。然后从 microSD 卡获取飞行日志，检查 EKF3 "
"新息值是否较低。位置、速度和偏航归一化新息值都应较低（低于 0.1）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:209
#: 2028480031ca436485273e802cc8c647
msgid ""
"Once you have confirmed low innovations you can try a flight in LOITER mode."
msgstr "确认新息值较低后，可以尝试在 Loiter 模式下飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:213
#: 1cb1db8f511d4ca2b4bed5b9e04f42d0
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "调参"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:215
#: f7bfcb23ada34e8aa465cbc326e4891c
msgid ""
"If you have significant vibration then you will likely want to de-weight the"
" accelerometers and instead tell the EKF to use the vicon data more. Try "
"setting EK3_ACC_P_NSE to 2.0 to de-weight the accelerometer data. You may "
"find this helps with position and height hold."
msgstr ""
"如果有明显震动，可能需要降低加速度计的权重，让 EKF 更多地使用 Vicon 数据。尝试将 EK3_ACC_P_NSE 设置为 2.0 "
"以降低加速度计数据的权重。这可能对位置和高度保持有所帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:221
#: b35aeed6288546d7a7a323587c4e22f3
msgid ""
"For indoor flightw with a Vicon setup and a small quad you can push up the "
"accelerations and yaw rate to much higher value than are used in a normal "
"quad. Some suggestions for a small racing quad are:"
msgstr "对于使用 Vicon 设置的小型四旋翼室内飞行，可以将加速度和偏航速率推到比普通四旋翼高得多的值。以下是小型竞速四旋翼的一些建议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:225
#: fbade821738e4d46947d9c796a05b4d6
msgid "INS_GYRO_FILTER=60"
msgstr "INS_GYRO_FILTER=60"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:226
#: 339cdf82d05e448eb28dfcf7f476a538
msgid "INS_ACCEL_FILTER=30"
msgstr "INS_ACCEL_FILTER=30"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:227
#: 54dae3580cff457f80636c4f9652a71d
msgid "ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX=100000"
msgstr "ATC_ACCEL_Y_MAX=100000"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:228
#: e8487af3df2f400f9c4fbc7185873a5a
msgid "ATC_SLEW_YAW=15000"
msgstr "ATC_SLEW_YAW=15000"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:231
#: 9ae20e1b1d8c4f719450f95c7566178a
msgid "Circle Mode"
msgstr "Circle 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:233
#: 88d561a7391040d39a9601c1a242ad8d
msgid ""
"A very useful mode for testing accuracy of flight is `Circle Mode <circle-"
"mode>`. To use it indoors try:"
msgstr "测试飞行精度的一个非常有用的模式是 `Circle 模式 <circle-mode>`。在室内使用时可以尝试："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:236
#: e5f17657f1ec417cbca85be1a79f863f
msgid "CIRCLE_RADIUS=100"
msgstr "CIRCLE_RADIUS=100"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:237
#: aa70d258e7524e239edd0e5952fbd459
msgid "CIRCLE_RATE=40"
msgstr "CIRCLE_RATE=40"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:239
#: 904698055f554006b9387d49dd2a81f2
msgid ""
"You should also set your RTL_ALT nice and low in case you hit a failsafe, or"
" configure a instant disarm switch on your transmitter for when things go "
"wrong."
msgstr "还应将 RTL_ALT 设置得足够低，以防触发失控保护时，或在遥控器上配置即时上锁开关以应对异常情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:243
#: b51c172a54fb4a94a4d4ab2ac62df9e8
msgid ""
"To fly in circle mode take off in LOITER and then move so you are 1m from "
"the center of the room, pointing towards the middle of the room. Then switch"
" to Circle mode and the vehicle should start circling, keeping its nose "
"pointed at the center of the circle. You can try pushing up CIRCLE_RATE to "
"higher values (in degrees/second) as you get more confident. The video at "
"the top of this page has CIRCLE_RATE=150 for a 150 degree/second circle."
msgstr ""
"在 Circle 模式下飞行，先在 Loiter 中起飞，然后移动到距房间中心 1m 处，朝向房间中央。然后切换到 Circle "
"模式，飞行器应开始绕圈，机头始终指向圆心。随着信心增加，可以尝试提高 CIRCLE_RATE 值（以度/秒为单位）。本页顶部的视频 "
"CIRCLE_RATE=150，即以 150 度/秒的速率绕圈。"
